<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">

<title>Fungsi Trigonometri Invers</title>
<metadata>
  <md:content-id>m49390</md:content-id>
  <md:title>Fungsi Trigonometri Invers</md:title>
  <md:abstract><para id="para-00001">Dalam bagian ini, Anda akan:</para>
<list id="list-00001">
<item>Memahami dan menggunakan fungsi sinus, kosinus, dan tangen invers.</item>
<item>Menentukan nilai eksak ekspresi yang melibatkan fungsi sinus, kosinus, dan tangen invers.</item>
<item>Gunakan kalkulator untuk mengevaluasi fungsi trigonometri invers.</item>
<item>Menentukan nilai eksak fungsi komposit yang melibatkan fungsi trigonometri invers.</item>
</list></md:abstract>
  <md:uuid>6883d2f3-f1d0-4c3b-b9bb-d2c1a1a1f950</md:uuid>
</metadata>

<content>
  <para id="fs-id1165135305803">Untuk setiap <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00001">segitiga siku-siku</term>, jika diketahui satu sudut lain dan panjang salah satu sisinya, kita dapat mengetahui berapa sudut dan sisi lainnya. Namun bagaimana jika kita hanya diberikan dua sisi pada sebuah segitiga siku-siku? Kita memerlukan prosedur yang mengarahkan kita dari perbandingan sisi ke sudut. Di sinilah gagasan tentang invers fungsi trigonometri berperan. Di bagian ini, kita akan menjelajahi <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00002">fungsi trigonometri invers</term>.</para><section id="fs-id1165135296329"><title>Memahami dan Menggunakan Fungsi Sinus, Kosinus, dan Tangen Invers</title><para id="fs-id1165133151767">Untuk menggunakan fungsi trigonometri invers, kita perlu memahami bahwa fungsi trigonometri invers “membalikkan” tindakan fungsi trigonometri asal, sama seperti fungsi lain dan inversnya. Dengan kata lain, domain fungsi invers adalah range fungsi asal dan sebaliknya, sebagaimana dirangkum dalam <link target-id="Figure_06_03_013" />.</para><figure id="Figure_06_03_013" class="medium"><media id="fs-id1165135301704" alt="Bagan bertuliskan “Fungsi Trigonometri”, “Fungsi Trigonometri Invers”, “Domain: Ukuran Sudut”, “Domain: Rasio”, “Range: Rasio”, dan “Range: Ukuran Sudut”.">
        <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_013.jpg" />

      </media>
    </figure><para id="fs-id1165134261704">Misalnya, jika <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> maka kita menulis <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
          <m:mi>f</m:mi>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> Perhatikan bahwa <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> tidak berarti <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>.</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> Contoh berikut menggambarkan fungsi trigonometri invers:</para><list id="fs-id1165134211370"><item>Karena <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtext>sin</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>6</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> maka <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mtext>sin</m:mtext>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>1</m:mn>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
      <item>Karena <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> maka <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </item>
      <item>Karena <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> maka <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mn>1</m:mn>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </item>
    </list><para id="fs-id1165135613089">Pada bagian-bagian sebelumnya, kita menghitung fungsi trigonometri pada berbagai sudut, tetapi kadang-kadang kita perlu mengetahui sudut yang menghasilkan nilai sinus, kosinus, atau tangen tertentu. Untuk itu diperlukan fungsi invers. Ingatlah bahwa, untuk <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00003">fungsi satu-ke-satu</term>, jika <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> maka fungsi invers memenuhi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mi>f</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para><para id="fs-id1165135708024">Perlu diingat bahwa fungsi sinus, kosinus, dan tangen bukan fungsi satu-ke-satu. Grafik setiap fungsi tidak lulus uji garis horizontal. Bahkan, tidak ada fungsi periodik yang dapat bersifat satu-ke-satu karena setiap keluaran dalam range-nya berkaitan dengan sedikitnya satu masukan pada setiap periode, sedangkan jumlah periodenya tak terhingga. Seperti fungsi lain yang tidak satu-ke-satu, kita perlu membatasi <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00004">domain</term> dari setiap fungsi untuk menghasilkan fungsi baru yang bersifat satu-ke-satu. Kita memilih domain setiap fungsi yang mencakup bilangan 0. <link target-id="Figure_06_03_001" /> menunjukkan grafik fungsi sinus yang dibatasi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan grafik fungsi kosinus dibatasi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para><figure id="Figure_06_03_001" class="small"><media id="fs-id1165134227892" alt="Dua grafik berdampingan. Grafik pertama, grafik A, menunjukkan setengah periode fungsi sinus x. Grafik kedua, grafik B, menunjukkan setengah periode fungsi kosinus x.">
        <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_001.jpg" />
      </media>

    <caption>(a) Fungsi sinus pada domain terbatas <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> (b) Fungsi kosinus pada domain terbatas <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</caption></figure><para id="fs-id1165137706264"><link target-id="Figure_06_03_003" /> menunjukkan grafik fungsi tangen yang dibatasi pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>

    <figure id="Figure_06_03_003" class="small"><media id="fs-id1165134272156" alt="Grafik satu periode tangen x, dari -pi/2 hingga pi/2.">
        <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_003.jpg" />
      </media>

    <caption>Fungsi tangen pada domain terbatas <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</caption></figure><para id="fs-id1165137665093">Pilihan konvensional untuk domain terbatas ini agak arbitrer, tetapi mempunyai karakteristik penting dan berguna. Setiap domain mencakup titik asal dan beberapa nilai positif; yang terpenting, setiap domain menghasilkan fungsi satu-ke-satu yang memiliki invers. Pilihan konvensional untuk domain terbatas fungsi tangen juga memiliki sifat berguna, yaitu membentang dari satu <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00005">asimtot vertikal</term> ke asimtot berikutnya, alih-alih terbagi menjadi dua bagian oleh sebuah asimtot.</para><para id="fs-id1165137827380">Pada domain terbatas ini, kita dapat mendefinisikan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00006">fungsi trigonometri invers</term>.</para><list id="fs-id1165135609242"><item> <term id="term-00007">fungsi sinus invers</term> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> artinya <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Fungsi sinus invers kadang-kadang disebut fungsi <term id="term-00008">arkus sinus</term> fungsi, dan dinotasikan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>arcsin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>

    <equation id="eip-738" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>memiliki domain</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>−1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>dan range</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item>
    <item> <term id="term-00009">fungsi kosinus invers</term> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> artinya <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Fungsi kosinus invers kadang-kadang disebut fungsi <term id="term-00010">arkus kosinus</term> fungsi, dan dinotasikan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>arccos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>

    <equation id="eip-980" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>memiliki domain</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>−1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>dan range</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item>
    <item> <term id="term-00011">fungsi tangen invers</term> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> artinya <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Fungsi tangen invers kadang-kadang disebut fungsi <term id="term-00012">arkus tangen</term> fungsi, dan dinotasikan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>arctan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>

    <equation id="eip-128" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>memiliki domain</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−∞</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>dan range</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item>
</list><para id="fs-id1165135181366">Grafik fungsi invers ditunjukkan pada <link target-id="Figure_06_03_004" />, <link target-id="Figure_06_03_005" />, dan <link target-id="Figure_06_03_006" />. Perhatikan bahwa keluaran setiap fungsi invers ini adalah <emphasis effect="italics">bilangan, </emphasis>sudut dalam ukuran radian. Kita melihat bahwa <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> memiliki domain <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
<m:mn>−1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan range <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> memiliki domain <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
<m:mn>−1</m:mn><m:mn>,1</m:mn>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan range <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> memiliki domain semua bilangan real dan range <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Untuk menemukan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00013">domain</term> dan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00014">range</term> fungsi trigonometri invers dengan mempertukarkan domain dan range fungsi asal. Setiap grafik fungsi trigonometri invers merupakan pencerminan grafik fungsi asal terhadap garis <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para><figure id="Figure_06_03_004" class="medium"><media id="fs-id1165135536457" alt="Grafik fungsi sinus x dan arkus sinus x. Garis putus-putus y=x di antara kedua grafik menunjukkan sifat invers kedua fungsi.">
        <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_004n.jpg" />
      </media>

    <caption>Fungsi sinus dan fungsi sinus invers (atau arkus sinus)</caption></figure><figure id="Figure_06_03_005" class="small"><media id="fs-id1165137676887" alt="Grafik fungsi kosinus x dan arkus kosinus x. Garis putus-putus y=x menunjukkan sifat invers kedua fungsi.">
        <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_005n.jpg" />
      </media>

    <caption>Fungsi kosinus dan fungsi kosinus invers (atau arkus kosinus)</caption></figure><figure id="Figure_06_03_006" class="small"><media id="fs-id1165133023652" alt="Grafik fungsi tangen x dan arkus tangen x. Garis putus-putus y=x menunjukkan sifat invers kedua fungsi.">
        <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_006n.jpg" />
      </media>

    <caption>Fungsi tangen dan fungsi tangen invers (atau arkus tangen)</caption></figure><note id="fs-id1165135528318">
      <label />
      <title>Hubungan Fungsi Sinus, Kosinus, dan Tangen Invers</title>
      <para id="fs-id1165137454943">Untuk sudut dalam interval <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> jika <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> maka <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para><para id="fs-id1165137940584">Untuk sudut dalam interval <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> jika <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> maka <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para><para id="fs-id1165133281445">Untuk sudut dalam interval <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> jika <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> maka <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para></note>

    <example id="Example_06_03_01">
      <exercise id="fs-id1165134031336">
        <problem id="fs-id1165134031338">
          <title>Menulis Relasi untuk Fungsi Invers</title>
          <para id="fs-id1165134031344">Diketahui <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>12</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>0.96593</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> tuliskan relasi yang melibatkan invers sinus.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1165137921545">
          <para id="fs-id1165137921547">Gunakan relasi untuk sinus invers. Jika <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> maka <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>. </para>

<para id="fs-id1165135543191">Dalam soal ini, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.96593</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>12</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
        <equation id="fs-id1165134255031" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.96593</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>12</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
</solution>
      </exercise>
    </example>

    <note id="fs-id1165134468915" class="precalculus try">
      <label>Cobalah</label>
      <exercise id="ti_06_03_01">
        <problem id="fs-id1165134246238"><para id="fs-id1165134246239">Diketahui <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>0.8776,</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> tuliskan relasi yang melibatkan kosinus invers.</para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1165135176654"><para id="fs-id1165135176655"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>arccos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.8776</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution>
      </exercise>
    </note>
  </section><section id="fs-id1165135364545">
<title>Menentukan Nilai Eksak Ekspresi yang Melibatkan Fungsi Sinus, Kosinus, dan Tangen Invers</title>
<para id="fs-id1165135364550">Setelah dapat mengidentifikasi fungsi invers, kita akan belajar mengevaluasinya. Untuk sebagian besar nilai dalam domainnya, fungsi trigonometri invers harus dievaluasi dengan kalkulator, interpolasi dari tabel, atau teknik numerik lain. Seperti pada fungsi trigonometri asal, kita dapat memberikan nilai eksak fungsi invers ketika menggunakan sudut istimewa, khususnya <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> (30°), <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> (45°), dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> (60°), dan refleksinya ke kuadran lain.</para><note id="fs-id1165135445917" class="how-to-notitle">
<label>Panduan</label>
<para id="fs-id1165135445923"><emphasis>Jika diberikan nilai masukan “istimewa”, hitunglah nilai fungsi trigonometri invers.</emphasis></para>
<list id="fs-id1165137664911" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Tentukan sudut <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> yang fungsi trigonometri aslinya memiliki keluaran yang sama dengan masukan yang diberikan untuk fungsi trigonometri invers.</item>
<item>Jika <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> tidak berada dalam range invers yang ditetapkan, carilah sudut lain <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> yang berada dalam range tersebut dan memiliki sinus, kosinus, atau tangen yang sama dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> bergantung pada fungsi invers yang diberikan.</item>
</list></note>

<example id="Example_06_03_02">
<exercise id="fs-id1165135241240">
<problem id="fs-id1165135241242">
<title>Mengevaluasi Fungsi Trigonometri Invers untuk Nilai Masukan Khusus</title>
<para id="fs-id1165131958333">Hitung nilai setiap ekspresi berikut.</para><list id="fs-id1165131958336" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mtext>sin</m:mtext>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>1</m:mn>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mtext>sin</m:mtext>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msqrt>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msqrt>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</item>
</list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165134118477">

<list id="fs-id1165134118479" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Mengevaluasi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>1</m:mn>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> sama dengan menentukan sudut yang mempunyai nilai sinus sebesar <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Dengan kata lain, sudut berapakah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> memenuhi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>?</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Ada beberapa nilai yang akan memenuhi hubungan ini, seperti <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> tetapi kita memerlukan sudut dalam interval <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> jadi jawabannya <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>1</m:mn>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Ingatlah bahwa invers adalah sebuah fungsi, jadi untuk setiap masukan, kita akan mendapatkan tepat satu keluaran.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Untuk mengevaluasi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msqrt>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> kita mengetahui bahwa <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> keduanya memiliki nilai sinus <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msqrt>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msqrt>

   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> tetapi tidak ada satu pun yang berada dalam interval <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Untuk itu, kita memerlukan sudut negatif yang koterminal dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>:</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mtext>sin</m:mtext>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msqrt>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msqrt>

   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span>Untuk mengevaluasi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msqrt>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> kita mencari sudut pada interval <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan nilai kosinus <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msqrt>
     <m:mn>3</m:mn>
    </m:msqrt>

   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Sudut yang memenuhi ini adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msqrt>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> Mengevaluasi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> kita mencari sudut pada interval <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan nilai tangen 1. Sudut yang benar adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</item>
</list></solution>
</exercise>
</example>

<note id="fs-id1165135571871" class="precalculus try">
<label>Cobalah</label>
<exercise id="ti_06_03_02">
<problem id="fs-id1165134373999"><para id="fs-id1165134374000">Hitung nilai setiap ekspresi berikut.</para><list id="fs-id1165134374003" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mtext>sin</m:mtext>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
<m:mn>−1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>−1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
<m:mn>−1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
<m:mn>−1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
<m:mn>−1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
<m:mn>−1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
<m:mn>−1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>1</m:mn>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</item>
</list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165134259305"><list id="fs-id1165134259306" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"> <item><span class="token">ⓐ</span><m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math></item> <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math></item>
</list></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>

<section id="fs-id1165135416507">
<title>Menggunakan Kalkulator untuk Mengevaluasi Fungsi Trigonometri Invers</title>
<para id="fs-id1165135416512">Untuk mengevaluasi <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00015">fungsi trigonometri invers</term> yang tidak melibatkan sudut istimewa yang telah dibahas, kita perlu menggunakan kalkulator atau teknologi lain. Sebagian besar kalkulator ilmiah dan aplikasi kalkulator memiliki tombol khusus untuk fungsi sinus, kosinus, dan tangen invers. Tombol-tombol itu dapat berlabel, misalnya, <emphasis>SIN</emphasis>
 <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mtext />
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
<m:mn>−1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>, <emphasis>ARCSIN</emphasis>, atau <emphasis>ASIN</emphasis>.</para><para id="fs-id1165133023027">Pada bab sebelumnya, kita mempelajari trigonometri pada segitiga siku-siku untuk menyelesaikan sisi-sisi segitiga jika diberi satu sisi dan tambahan sudut. Dengan menggunakan fungsi trigonometri invers, kita dapat mencari sudut suatu segitiga siku-siku jika terdapat dua sisi, dan kita dapat menggunakan kalkulator untuk mencari nilai hingga beberapa tempat desimal.</para>
<para id="fs-id1165133023033">Dalam contoh dan latihan ini, jawabannya akan diartikan sebagai sudut dan kita akan menggunakan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> sebagai variabel independen. Nilai yang ditampilkan pada kalkulator mungkin dalam derajat atau radian, jadi pastikan untuk mengatur mode yang sesuai dengan aplikasi.</para><example id="Example_06_03_03">
<exercise id="fs-id1165134031321">
<problem id="fs-id1165134031324">
<title>Mengevaluasi Sinus Invers dengan Kalkulator</title>
<para id="fs-id1165134031329">Hitung <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.97</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> menggunakan kalkulator.</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135486002">
<para id="fs-id1165135486004">Karena keluaran fungsi invers berupa sudut, kalkulator akan memberi kita nilai derajat jika dalam mode derajat dan nilai radian jika dalam mode radian. Kalkulator juga menggunakan batasan domain yang sama pada sudut seperti yang kita gunakan.</para>
<para id="fs-id1165135486009">Dalam mode radian, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.97</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>1.3252.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Dalam mode derajat, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.97</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>75.93°.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Perhatikan bahwa dalam kalkulus dan seterusnya kita akan menggunakan radian di hampir semua kasus.</para></solution>
</exercise>
</example>

<note id="fs-id1165134199522" class="precalculus try">
<label>Cobalah</label>
<exercise id="ti_06_03_03">
<problem id="fs-id1165134199531"><para id="fs-id1165134199532">Hitung <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.4</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> menggunakan kalkulator.</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165131896087"><para id="fs-id1165134572550">1.9823 atau 113.578°</para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>

<note id="fs-id1165134572555" class="how-to-notitle"><label>Panduan</label>
<para id="fs-id1165134572561"><emphasis>Jika diberikan dua sisi segitiga siku-siku seperti pada <link target-id="Figure_06_03_012" />, tentukan sebuah sudut.
</emphasis></para>

<figure id="Figure_06_03_012" class="small">
      <media id="fs-id1165134109641" alt="Ilustrasi segitiga siku-siku dengan sudut theta. Berdekatan dengan theta adalah sisi a, di seberang theta adalah sisi p, dan sisi miring adalah sisi h.">
        <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_012.jpg" />
      </media>
    </figure>

<list id="fs-id1165134109652" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Jika salah satu sisi yang diketahui adalah sisi miring dengan panjang <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>h</m:mi></m:mrow>
 </m:math> dan sisi dengan panjang <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow>
 </m:math> yang berdekatan dengan sudut yang dicari juga diketahui, gunakan persamaan <m:math>
  <m:mrow><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
   </m:msup>
   <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>a</m:mi>
      <m:mi>h</m:mi>
     </m:mfrac>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
 <item>Jika salah satu sisi yang diketahui adalah sisi miring dengan panjang <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>h</m:mi></m:mrow>
 </m:math> dan sisi dengan panjang <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>p</m:mi></m:mrow>
 </m:math> yang berhadapan dengan sudut yang dicari juga diketahui, gunakan persamaan <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
   </m:msup>
   <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>p</m:mi>
      <m:mi>h</m:mi>
     </m:mfrac>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:math>
</item>
 <item>Jika kedua sisi siku-siku diberikan, gunakan persamaan <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
   </m:msup>
   <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>p</m:mi>
      <m:mi>a</m:mi>
     </m:mfrac>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
</list></note><example id="Example_06_03_04">
<exercise id="fs-id1165135466364">
<problem id="fs-id1165135466366">
<title>Menerapkan Kosinus Invers pada Segitiga Siku-Siku</title>
 <para id="fs-id1165135466372">Selesaikan segitiga pada <link target-id="Figure_06_03_007" /> untuk sudut <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </para>
<figure id="Figure_06_03_007" class="small">
 <media id="fs-id1165135646105" alt="Ilustrasi segitiga siku-siku dengan sudut theta. Berdekatan dengan sudut theta terdapat sebuah sisi dengan panjang 9 dan sisi miring dengan panjang 12.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_007.jpg" />
</media>
</figure>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135646117">
<para id="fs-id1165135646119">Karena kita mengetahui sisi miring dan sisi yang berdekatan dengan sudut, masuk akal jika kita menggunakan fungsi kosinus.</para>

 <equation id="fs-id1165134094463" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>9</m:mn>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>12</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable>
       <m:mtr>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>9</m:mn>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>12</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable>
       <m:mtr>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable><m:mtext>Terapkan definisi invers</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>0.7227</m:mn><m:mtext> atau sekitar </m:mtext><m:mn>41.4096°</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable>
       <m:mtr>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable><m:mtext>Hitung</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
</exercise>
</example>

<note id="fs-id1165137737008" class="precalculus try">
<label>Cobalah</label>
<exercise id="fs-id1165134159702">
 <problem id="fs-id1165134159704"><para id="fs-id1165137737014">Selesaikan segitiga pada <link target-id="Figure_06_03_008" /> untuk sudut <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </para>

<figure id="Figure_06_03_008" class="small">
 <media id="fs-id1165137769688" alt="Ilustrasi segitiga siku-siku dengan sudut theta. Berhadapan dengan sudut theta terdapat sebuah sisi yang panjangnya 6 dan sisi miringnya 10.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_008.jpg" />
</media>
</figure>
</problem>
 <solution id="fs-id1165135242701"><para id="fs-id1165135242702"> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:msup>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
    <m:mrow>
<m:mn>−1</m:mn></m:mrow>
   </m:msup>
   <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.6</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>36.87°</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.6435</m:mn></m:mrow>
 </m:math> radian</para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>

 <section id="fs-id1165132971652">
  <title>Menentukan Nilai Eksak Fungsi Komposit dengan Fungsi Trigonometri Invers</title>
  <para id="fs-id1165132971657">Ada kalanya kita perlu mengomposisikan fungsi trigonometri dengan fungsi trigonometri invers. Dalam kasus tersebut, nilai eksak ekspresi yang dihasilkan biasanya dapat ditentukan tanpa kalkulator. Bahkan ketika masukan fungsi komposit berupa variabel atau ekspresi, bentuk keluarannya sering dapat ditentukan. Untuk membedakan berbagai kasus, misalkan <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:math> dan <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:math> adalah dua fungsi trigonometri berbeda dalam himpunan <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>{</m:mo> <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow> <m:mo>}</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
  </m:math>, serta misalkan <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mi>f</m:mi>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:math> dan <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mi>g</m:mi>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:math> adalah inversnya.</para>

  <section id="fs-id1165135173155"><title>Mengevaluasi Komposisi Berbentuk <emphasis effect="italics">f</emphasis>(<emphasis effect="italics">f</emphasis><sup>−1</sup>(<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>)) dan <emphasis effect="italics">f</emphasis><sup>−1</sup>(<emphasis effect="italics">f</emphasis>(<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>))</title><para id="fs-id1165137663805">Untuk fungsi trigonometri apa pun, <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mi>f</m:mi>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>y</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> untuk semua <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> dalam domain yang sesuai bagi fungsi tersebut. Hal ini mengikuti definisi invers dan fakta bahwa range <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>f</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> didefinisikan identik dengan domain <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:msup>
      <m:mi>f</m:mi>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
     </m:msup>
     <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> Namun, kita harus sedikit lebih berhati-hati dengan ekspresi bentuk <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:msup>
      <m:mi>f</m:mi>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
     </m:msup>
     <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math>
   </para>

   <note id="fs-id1165135332809">

    <title>Komposisi Fungsi Trigonometri dan Inversnya</title>
    <equation id="fs-id1165135332818" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>untuk</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>untuk</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>untuk</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<para id="eip-428"><newline count="1" /></para>
<equation id="fs-id1165134061929" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>hanya untuk </m:mtext><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>hanya untuk </m:mtext><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>hanya untuk </m:mtext><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></note>

   <note id="fs-id1165135361177" class="precalculus qa">
    <label>Tanya Jawab</label>
    <para id="fs-id1165135361183"><emphasis>Benarkah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>?</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
    </emphasis></para><para id="fs-id1165137921510"><emphasis effect="italics">Tidak. Persamaan ini benar jika <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math> termasuk dalam domain terbatas <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> tetapi sinus didefinisikan untuk semua masukan real, dan untuk <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math> di luar interval terbatas, persamaan tersebut tidak benar karena inversnya selalu mengembalikan nilai dalam <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> Situasinya serupa untuk kosinus dan tangen beserta inversnya. Misalnya, <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>4</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </emphasis></para></note>

   <note id="fs-id1165135453004" class="how-to-notitle">
    <label>Panduan</label>
   <para id="fs-id1165135453010"><emphasis>Jika diberikan ekspresi berbentuk f<sup>−1</sup>(f(θ)) dengan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext> atau </m:mtext><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> hitunglah nilainya.</emphasis>
   </para><list id="fs-id1165134232198" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Jika <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math> berada dalam domain terbatas <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext> maka </m:mtext><m:msup>
   <m:mi>f</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Jika tidak, carilah sudut <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>ϕ</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math> dalam domain terbatas <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>f</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math> sedemikian sehingga <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>ϕ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> Maka <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>ϕ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
   </list></note>

   <example id="Example_06_03_05">
    <exercise id="fs-id1165134154532">
     <problem id="fs-id1165134154534">
      <title>Menggunakan Fungsi Trigonometri Invers</title>
      <para id="fs-id1165134154540">Hitung nilai berikut:</para>
      <list id="fs-id1165134154543" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mfrac>
              <m:mi>π</m:mi>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
             </m:mfrac>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
       </m:math>
       </item>
       <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
               <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
             </m:mfrac>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
       </m:math>
       </item>
       <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
               <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
             </m:mfrac>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
       </m:math>
       </item>
       <item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mi>π</m:mi>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
             </m:mfrac>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
       </m:math>
       </item>
      </list></problem>
     <solution id="fs-id1165134069364">
     <list id="fs-id1165134069366" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
      <item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mtext> berada dalam </m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
         <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> jadi <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mi>π</m:mi>
             <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </item>
      <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mtext> tidak berada dalam </m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
       </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> tapi <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> jadi <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
             <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </item>
      <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mtext> berada dalam </m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> jadi <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
             <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </item>
      <item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mtext> tidak berada dalam </m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> tapi <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
      </m:math> karena kosinus merupakan fungsi genap.
       <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mtext> berada dalam </m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> jadi <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
             <m:mi>π</m:mi>
             <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </item>
     </list>
     </solution>
    </exercise>
   </example>

   <note id="fs-id1165137848808" class="precalculus try">
    <label>Cobalah</label>
    <exercise id="ti_06_03_04">
     <problem id="fs-id1165137848817"><para id="fs-id1165137848818">Hitung <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
            <m:mn>8</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>dan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
            <m:mn>9</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
     <solution id="fs-id1165135543133"><para id="fs-id1165135543134"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>8</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>;</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mn>9</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></solution>
    </exercise>
   </note>

  </section><section id="fs-id1165135149890"><title>Mengevaluasi Komposisi Berbentuk <emphasis effect="italics">f</emphasis><sup>−1</sup>(<emphasis effect="italics">g</emphasis>(<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>))</title><para id="fs-id1165134203429">Setelah dapat mengomposisikan fungsi trigonometri dengan inversnya, kita dapat mempelajari cara mengevaluasi komposisi suatu fungsi trigonometri dengan invers fungsi trigonometri lain. Kita mulai dengan komposisi berbentuk <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:msup>
      <m:mi>f</m:mi>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
     </m:msup>
     <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> Untuk nilai khusus <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> kita dapat mengevaluasi fungsi bagian dalam dengan tepat dan kemudian fungsi invers bagian luar. Namun, kita dapat menemukan pendekatan yang lebih umum dengan mempertimbangkan hubungan antara dua sudut lancip pada segitiga siku-siku yang salah satunya berada <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> membuat yang lain <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>π</m:mi>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:mfrac>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> Perhatikan sinus dan kosinus setiap sudut segitiga siku-siku di <link target-id="Figure_06_03_009" />.</para><figure id="Figure_06_03_009" class="small">
    <media id="fs-id1165135634376" alt="Ilustrasi segitiga siku-siku dengan sudut theta dan pi/2 - theta. Berhadapan dengan sudut theta dan berdekatan dengan sudut pi/2-theta terdapat sisi a. Berdekatan dengan sudut theta dan berhadapan dengan sudut pi/2 - theta adalah sisi b. Sisi miring diberi label c.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_009.jpg" />
    </media>
    <caption>Segitiga siku-siku yang menggambarkan hubungan kofungsi</caption>
   </figure>

   <para id="fs-id1165135634018">Karena <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>b</m:mi>
      <m:mi>c</m:mi>
     </m:mfrac>
     <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> kita punya <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:msup>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
     </m:msup>
     <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> jika <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> Jika <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> tidak berada dalam domain ini, maka kita perlu mencari sudut lain yang kosinusnya sama dengan <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> dan termasuk dalam domain terbatas; kemudian kita mengurangkan sudut ini dari <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>π</m:mi>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:mfrac>
     <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> Demikian pula, <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>a</m:mi>
      <m:mi>c</m:mi>
     </m:mfrac>
     <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> jadi <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:msup>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
     </m:msup>
     <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> jika <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>π</m:mi>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:mfrac>
     <m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>π</m:mi>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:mfrac>
     <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> Ini hanyalah hubungan fungsi-kofungsi yang disajikan dengan cara lain.</para><note id="fs-id1165135449630" class="how-to-notitle">
    <label>Panduan</label>
    <para id="fs-id1165135449637"><emphasis>Jika diberikan fungsi berbentuk <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math> dan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> hitunglah nilainya.</emphasis>
    </para><list id="fs-id1165134137694" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Jika <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mtext> berada dalam </m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> maka <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </item>
     <item>Jika <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mtext> tidak berada dalam </m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> maka carilah sudut lain <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mtext> dalam </m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math> sedemikian sehingga <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
      <equation id="fs-id1165137480236" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation></item>
     <item>Jika <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mtext> berada dalam </m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
       </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> maka <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </item>
     <item>Jika <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mtext> tidak berada dalam</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
       </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> maka carilah sudut lain <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mtext> dalam </m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
       </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math> sedemikian sehingga <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
      <equation id="fs-id1165135449778" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation>
      </item>
    </list></note>

   <example id="Example_06_03_06"><exercise id="fs-id1165134042260">
     <problem id="fs-id1165134042262">
      <title>Mengevaluasi Komposisi Sinus Invers dengan Kosinus</title>
      <para id="fs-id1165134042267">Hitung <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
             <m:mn>6</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para>
      <list id="fs-id1165134123051" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span>dengan evaluasi langsung.</item>
      <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> dengan metode yang dijelaskan sebelumnya.</item>
      </list></problem>
     <solution id="fs-id1165134123061">


     <list id="fs-id1165134043914" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Di sini kita bisa langsung mengevaluasi bagian dalam komposisinya.
       <equation id="fs-id1165134043918" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable columnalign="left">
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>6</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>6</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mtext>               </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>6</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mtext>               </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:msqrt>
             <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:msqrt>

           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation><para id="fs-id1165134130058">Sekarang, kita dapat mengevaluasi fungsi invers seperti yang kita lakukan sebelumnya.</para>
      <equation id="fs-id1165134130061" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:msqrt>
             <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:msqrt>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation>
</item>
      <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Kita memiliki <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mtext>,</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan
       <equation id="fs-id1165135682650" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="right">
   <m:mtr columnalign="right">
    <m:mtd columnalign="right">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>6</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>6</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="right">
    <m:mtd columnalign="right">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mtext>       </m:mtext>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item>
     </list></solution>
    </exercise>
   </example><note id="fs-id1165135523406" class="precalculus try">
    <label>Cobalah</label>
    <exercise id="ti_06_03_05">
     <problem id="fs-id1165135347339"><para id="fs-id1165135347340">Hitung <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
     <solution id="fs-id1165137843141"><para id="fs-id1165137843142"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mn>4</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></solution>
    </exercise>
   </note>

  </section><section id="fs-id1165137843168"><title>Mengevaluasi Komposisi Berbentuk <emphasis effect="italics">f</emphasis>(<emphasis effect="italics">g</emphasis><sup>−1</sup>(<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>))</title><para id="fs-id1165135466406">Untuk mengevaluasi komposisi berbentuk <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mi>g</m:mi>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> dengan <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>f</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> dan <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>g</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> adalah dua fungsi sinus, kosinus, atau tangen dan <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> adalah masukan apa pun dalam domain <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:msup>
      <m:mi>g</m:mi>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
     </m:msup>
     <m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> kita memiliki rumus eksak, misalnya <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>
     <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> Jika diperlukan, rumus-rumus ini dapat diturunkan dari hubungan trigonometri antara sudut dan sisi segitiga siku-siku, bersama dengan hubungan Pythagoras antara panjang sisi-sisinya. Kita dapat menggunakan identitas Pythagoras, <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:msup>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:msup>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:msup>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> untuk menentukan yang satu jika yang lain diketahui. Kita juga dapat menggunakan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00016">fungsi trigonometri invers</term> untuk menemukan komposisi yang melibatkan ekspresi aljabar.</para><example id="Example_06_03_07">
    <exercise id="fs-id1165135258231">
     <problem id="fs-id1165135258234">
      <title>Mengevaluasi Komposisi Sinus dengan Kosinus Invers</title>
      <para id="fs-id1165135365009">Tentukan nilai eksak <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mn>4</m:mn>
             <m:mn>5</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para>
     </problem>
     <solution id="fs-id1165135521197">
      <para id="fs-id1165135521199">Dari fungsi bagian dalam, misalkan ada sudut yang memenuhi <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
           <m:mn>5</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> yang artinya <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan kita mencari <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> Kita dapat menggunakan identitas Pythagoras untuk melakukan ini. </para>
<equation id="fs-id1165135432810" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Gunakan nilai kosinus yang diketahui</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Tentukan sinus</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>16</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>25</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>9</m:mn>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>25</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       <m:mn>5</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1165137832718">Karena <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
           <m:mn>5</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
      </m:math> berada di kuadran I, <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
      </m:math> harus positif, jadi solusinya <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> Lihat <link target-id="Figure_06_03_010" />.</para><figure id="Figure_06_03_010" class="small"><media id="fs-id1165135673473" alt="Ilustrasi segitiga siku-siku dengan sudut theta. Sisi di hadapan sudut theta panjangnya 3. Sisi yang berdekatan dengan sudut theta panjangnya 4. Sisi miring panjangnya 5.">
       <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_010.jpg" />
      </media>

     <caption>Segitiga siku-siku yang menunjukkan bahwa jika <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> maka <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </caption></figure><para id="fs-id1165134040462">Kita mengetahui bahwa kosinus invers selalu menghasilkan sudut pada interval <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> jadi kita tahu bahwa sinus sudut itu pasti positif; oleh karena itu <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
       <m:mn>5</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
   <m:mn>5</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>

      </para></solution>
    </exercise>
   </example>

   <note id="fs-id1165135176852" class="precalculus try">
    <label>Cobalah</label>
    <exercise id="ti_06_03_06">
     <problem id="fs-id1165135176861"><para id="fs-id1165135176862">Hitung <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
     <solution id="fs-id1165134183828"><para id="fs-id1165134183829"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></solution>
    </exercise>
   </note>

   <example id="Example_06_03_08">
    <exercise id="fs-id1165134183857">
     <problem id="fs-id1165134183859">
      <title>Mengevaluasi Komposisi Sinus dengan Tangen Invers</title>
      <para id="fs-id1165134183864">Tentukan nilai eksak <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mn>7</m:mn>
             <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para>
     </problem>
     <solution id="fs-id1165137898214">
      <para id="fs-id1165137898216">Meskipun kita bisa menggunakan teknik serupa seperti pada <link target-id="Example_06_03_06" />, di sini kita akan menunjukkan teknik lain. Dari fungsi bagian dalam, kita mengetahui bahwa ada sudut yang memenuhi <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>7</m:mn>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> Kita dapat membayangkannya sebagai sisi berhadapan dan berdekatan pada segitiga siku-siku, seperti ditunjukkan pada <link target-id="Figure_06_03_011" />.</para><figure id="Figure_06_03_011" class="small"><media id="fs-id1165134086121" alt="Ilustrasi segitiga siku-siku dengan sudut theta. Berdekatan dengan sudut theta terdapat sebuah sisi yang panjangnya 4. Di seberang sudut theta terdapat sebuah sisi yang panjangnya 7.">
       <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_011n.jpg" />
      </media>

     <caption>Segitiga siku-siku yang dua sisinya diketahui</caption></figure><para id="fs-id1165134086135">Dengan menggunakan Teorema Pythagoras, kita dapat mencari sisi miring segitiga ini.</para>
<equation id="fs-id1165134086138" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable columnalign="left">
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mtext>      </m:mtext><m:msup>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
           <m:mn>7</m:mn>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mtext>sisi miring</m:mtext>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>sisi miring</m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>65</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1165135445660">Sekarang, kita dapat menghitung sinus sudut sebagai sisi berlawanan dibagi sisi miring.</para>
      <equation id="fs-id1165135445663" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>7</m:mn>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>65</m:mn></m:mrow>
          </m:msqrt>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation><para id="fs-id1165135445697">Ini memberi kita komposisi yang kita inginkan.</para>
      <equation id="fs-id1165135445701" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mn>7</m:mn>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                      </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>7</m:mn>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>65</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                      </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>65</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>65</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
    </exercise>
   </example>

   <note id="fs-id1165137676834" class="precalculus try">
    <label>Cobalah</label>
    <exercise id="ti_06_03_07">
     <problem id="fs-id1165137676844"><para id="fs-id1165137676845">Hitung <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>7</m:mn>
            <m:mn>9</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
     <solution id="fs-id1165134168380"><para id="fs-id1165134168381"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msqrt>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         </m:msqrt>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mn>9</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></solution>
    </exercise>
   </note>

   <example id="Example_06_03_09">
    <exercise id="fs-id1165134168413">
     <problem id="fs-id1165134168415">
      <title>Menentukan Kosinus dari Sinus Invers suatu Ekspresi Aljabar</title>
      <para id="fs-id1165134478955">Tentukan bentuk sederhana untuk <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mi>x</m:mi>
             <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
      </m:math> untuk <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>3.</m:mn></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para>
     </problem>
     <solution id="fs-id1165134422226">
      <para id="fs-id1165134422228">Kita mengetahui bahwa ada sudut <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
      </m:math> sedemikian sehingga <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para>
<equation id="fs-id1165134422271" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Gunakan Teorema Pythagoras</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>x</m:mi>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Tentukan kosinus</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>9</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
           <m:mi>x</m:mi>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>9</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
           <m:mi>x</m:mi>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1165134372845">Karena kita tahu bahwa sinus invers harus memberikan sudut pada interval <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
         <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math> kita dapat menyimpulkan bahwa kosinus sudut tersebut pasti positif.</para>
<equation id="fs-id1165135319998" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mi>x</m:mi>
             <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:msqrt>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
             </m:msup>
            </m:mrow>
           </m:msqrt>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation></solution>
    </exercise>
   </example>

   <note id="fs-id1165133092635" class="precalculus try">
    <label>Cobalah</label>
    <exercise id="ti_06_03_08">
     <problem id="fs-id1165133092645"><para id="fs-id1165133092646">Tentukan bentuk sederhana untuk <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math> untuk <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn>
        <m:mn>4</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn>
        <m:mn>4</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
     <solution id="fs-id1165137846318"><para id="fs-id1165137846319"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msqrt>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mn>16</m:mn><m:msup>
            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:msup>
           <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msqrt>
        </m:mrow>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></solution>
    </exercise>
   </note>

   <note id="fs-id1165134282131" class="precalculus media media-notitle">
    <label>Media</label>
    <para id="fs-id1165134282138">Akses sumber online ini untuk instruksi dan latihan tambahan dengan fungsi trigonometri invers.</para>
    <list id="fs-id1165134282142">
     <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/evalinverstrig">Menghitung Ekspresi yang Melibatkan Fungsi Trigonometri Invers</link></item>
    </list>
   </note>
 </section></section>

 <section id="fs-id1165134282154" class="key-concepts">
  <title>Konsep Utama</title><list id="fs-id1165134282157"><item>Fungsi invers adalah fungsi yang “membalikkan” tindakan fungsi lain. Domain fungsi invers adalah range fungsi asal, sedangkan range fungsi invers adalah domain fungsi asal.</item>
  <item>Karena fungsi trigonometri tidak satu-ke-satu pada domain alaminya, fungsi trigonometri invers didefinisikan pada domain terbatas.</item>
   <item>Untuk fungsi trigonometri apa pun <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> jika <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
      <m:mi>f</m:mi>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
     </m:msup>
     <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> maka <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> Namun, <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> hanya menyiratkan <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
      <m:mi>f</m:mi>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
     </m:msup>
     <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> jika <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> berada dalam domain terbatas <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> Lihat <link target-id="Example_06_03_01" />.</item>
   <item>Sudut istimewa adalah keluaran fungsi trigonometri invers untuk nilai masukan khusus; misalnya, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>dan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>1</m:mn>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Lihat <link target-id="Example_06_03_02" />.</item>
   <item>Kalkulator akan mengembalikan sudut dalam domain terbatas dari fungsi trigonometri asli. Lihat <link target-id="Example_06_03_03" />.</item>
   <item>Fungsi invers memungkinkan kita mencari sudut jika diketahui dua sisi segitiga siku-siku. Lihat <link target-id="Example_06_03_04" />.</item>
   <item>Dalam komposisi fungsi, jika fungsi di dalamnya merupakan fungsi trigonometri invers, maka terdapat ekspresi eksak; misalnya, <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>
     <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> Lihat <link target-id="Example_06_03_05" />.</item>
   <item>Jika fungsi di dalamnya adalah fungsi trigonometri, maka kombinasi yang mungkin hanyalah <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:msup>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
     </m:msup>
     <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> jika <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> dan <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:msup>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
     </m:msup>
     <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> jika <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>     Lihat <link target-id="Example_06_03_06" /> dan <link target-id="Example_06_03_07" />.</item>
   <item>Saat mengevaluasi komposisi fungsi trigonometri dengan fungsi trigonometri invers, gambarlah segitiga acuan untuk membantu menentukan perbandingan sisi-sisi yang mewakili keluaran fungsi trigonometri. Lihat <link target-id="Example_06_03_08" />.</item>
   <item>Saat mengevaluasi komposisi fungsi trigonometri dengan fungsi trigonometri invers, Anda dapat menggunakan identitas trigonometri untuk membantu menentukan perbandingan sisi. Lihat <link target-id="Example_06_03_09" />.</item>
  </list></section>

 <section id="fs-id1165135621936" class="section-exercises">

  <title>Latihan Bagian</title><section id="fs-id1165135621940">
   <title>Verbal</title>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135621946">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135621948">
     <para id="fs-id1165135621950">Mengapa fungsi <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> dan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> memiliki range yang berbeda?</para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165135316170">
     <para id="fs-id1165135316172">Fungsi <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> bersifat satu-ke-satu pada <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
       </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> sehingga interval ini merupakan range fungsi invers <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> Fungsi <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> bersifat satu-ke-satu pada <m:math>
      <m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> sehingga interval ini merupakan range fungsi invers <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134381740">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134381742"><para id="fs-id1165134081543">Karena fungsi <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math> saling invers, mengapa <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>6</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math> tidak sama dengan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>6</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
</para></problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134301534">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134301536">
     <para id="fs-id1165134301538">Jelaskan makna <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>6</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>arcsin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>0.5</m:mn></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1165134301579">
    <para id="fs-id1165134301581"> <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>6</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> adalah ukuran radian sudut antara <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:math> yang sinusnya 0.5. </para>
   </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134386661">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134386663">
     <para id="fs-id1165134386665">Sebagian besar kalkulator tidak memiliki tombol untuk mengevaluasi <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sec</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> Jelaskan bagaimana hal ini dapat dilakukan dengan menggunakan fungsi kosinus atau fungsi kosinus invers.</para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165133306974">
    <problem id="fs-id1165133306976">
     <para id="fs-id1165133306978">Mengapa domain fungsi sinus, <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> dibatasi <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
       </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math> agar fungsi sinus invers ada?</para></problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1165133307043">
    <para id="fs-id1165133307046"> Agar suatu fungsi memiliki invers, fungsi tersebut harus satu-ke-satu dan lulus uji garis horizontal. Fungsi sinus biasa tidak satu-ke-satu kecuali domainnya dibatasi. Para matematikawan telah bersepakat untuk membatasi fungsi sinus pada interval <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math> agar fungsi tersebut satu-ke-satu dan memiliki invers. </para>
   </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165132914236">
    <problem id="fs-id1165132914238">
     <para id="fs-id1165132914240">Diskusikan mengapa pernyataan ini salah: <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>arccos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> untuk semua <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
      </para></problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135538988"><problem id="fs-id1165135538990">
     <para id="fs-id1165135538992">Tentukan apakah pernyataan berikut ini benar atau salah dan jelaskan jawaban Anda: <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>arccos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>arccos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1165135539031">
    <para id="fs-id1165135539033">Benar. Sudut <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msub>
       <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
      </m:msub>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> yang sama dengan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>arccos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>, dengan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow>
    </m:math>, merupakan sudut kuadran II dengan sudut acuan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msub>
       <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msub>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>, dengan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msub>
       <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msub>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> sama dengan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>arccos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math>, dengan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow>
    </m:math>. Karena <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msub>
       <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msub>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> adalah sudut acuan bagi <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msub>
       <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
      </m:msub>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:math>, berlaku <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msub>
       <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msub>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msub>
       <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
      </m:msub>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>arccos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> = <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>arccos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math>- </para>
   </solution>
   </exercise></section>
  <section id="fs-id1165133249100">
   <title>Aljabar</title>
   <para id="fs-id1165133249106">Untuk latihan berikut, hitunglah nilai ekspresi.</para>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165133249109">
    <problem id="fs-id1165133249111">
     <para id="fs-id1165133249113"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:msqrt>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:msqrt>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135263585">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135263587">
     <para id="fs-id1165135263589"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1165135263636">
    <para id="fs-id1165135263638"> <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>6</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para>
   </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135538607">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135538609">
     <para id="fs-id1165135538611"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135538657">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135538659">
     <para id="fs-id1165135538662"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:msqrt>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:msqrt>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165131963241">
     <para id="fs-id1165131963243"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mn>4</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165131963268">
    <problem id="fs-id1165131963270">
     <para id="fs-id1165131963272"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135407237">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135407239">
     <para id="fs-id1165135407241"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
          <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         </m:msqrt>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165135407285">
     <para id="fs-id1165135407287"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135407309">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135407311">
     <para id="fs-id1165135407313"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135459782">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135459784">
     <para id="fs-id1165135459787"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msqrt>
          <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         </m:msqrt>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165135459828">
     <para id="fs-id1165135459830"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135238376">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135238378">
     <para id="fs-id1165135238381"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:msqrt>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
           </m:msqrt>
          </m:mrow>
         </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>

   <para id="fs-id1165135238437">Untuk latihan berikut, gunakan kalkulator untuk mengevaluasi setiap ekspresi. Nyatakan jawaban ke perseratus terdekat.</para>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135238441">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135238444">
     <para id="fs-id1165135238446"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.4</m:mn></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165134212021">
     <para id="fs-id1165134212023">1.98</para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134212029">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134212031">
     <para id="fs-id1165134212033"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>arcsin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>0.23</m:mn></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134212058">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134212060">
     <para id="fs-id1165134212062"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>arccos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          <m:mn>5</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165134149965">
     <para id="fs-id1165134149968"> 0.93 </para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134149973">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134149975">
     <para id="fs-id1165134149977"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>0.8</m:mn></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134150016">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134150018">
     <para id="fs-id1165134150020"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165135672744">
     <para id="fs-id1165135672746">1.41</para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>

   <para id="fs-id1165135672752">Untuk latihan berikut, carilah sudut <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> pada segitiga siku-siku yang diberikan. Bulatkan jawaban ke perseratus terdekat.</para><exercise id="fs-id1165135672768"><problem id="fs-id1165135672770">
      <media id="fs-id1165135672779" alt="Ilustrasi segitiga siku-siku dengan sudut theta. Di seberang sudut theta terdapat sebuah sisi yang panjangnya 7. Sisi miringnya mempunyai panjang 10." display="block">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_201.jpg" />
    </media>
      </problem>
     </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165135672796"><problem id="fs-id1165135672798">

    <media id="fs-id1165135672807" alt="Ilustrasi segitiga siku-siku dengan sudut theta. Berdekatan dengan sudut theta terdapat sebuah sisi yang panjangnya 19. Di seberang sudut theta terdapat sebuah sisi yang panjangnya 12." display="block">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_202.jpg" />
    </media>

  </problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1165135672822">
    <para id="fs-id1165135672824">0.56 radian </para>
   </solution>
 </exercise><para id="fs-id1165134189032">Untuk latihan berikut, carilah nilai eksaknya, jika memungkinkan, tanpa kalkulator. Jika tidak memungkinkan, jelaskan alasannya.</para>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134189037">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134189039">
     <para id="fs-id1165134189041"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134189089">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134189091">
     <para id="fs-id1165134189093"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1165135186154">
    <para id="fs-id1165135186156">0 </para>
   </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135186162">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135186164">
     <para id="fs-id1165135186166"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135186223">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135186226">
     <para id="fs-id1165135186228"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165132005277">
     <para id="fs-id1165132005280">0.71 </para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165132005285">
    <problem id="fs-id1165132005287">
     <para id="fs-id1165132005289"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165137898724">
    <problem id="fs-id1165137898726">
     <para id="fs-id1165137898728"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165133362041">
     <para id="fs-id1165133362043">-0.71 </para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165133362048">
    <problem id="fs-id1165133362051">
     <para id="fs-id1165133362053"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
            <m:mn>6</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165133362115">
    <problem id="fs-id1165133362117">
     <para id="fs-id1165133362119"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165134248752">
     <para id="fs-id1165134248754"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>4</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134248776">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134248779">
     <para id="fs-id1165134248781"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135149975">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135149977">
     <para id="fs-id1165135149979"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165134261735">
     <para id="fs-id1165134261737">0.8 </para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134261742">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134261745">
     <para id="fs-id1165134261747"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134261804">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134261806">
     <para id="fs-id1165134261809"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow>
            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165132947330">
     <para id="fs-id1165132947332"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165132947354">
    <problem id="fs-id1165132947356">
     <para id="fs-id1165132947359"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>1</m:mn>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>


   <para id="fs-id1165135367775">Untuk latihan berikut, tentukan nilai eksak ekspresi dalam bentuk <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math>
    dengan bantuan segitiga referensi.</para>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135367791">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135367794">
     <para id="fs-id1165135367796"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165135367849">
     <para id="fs-id1165135367851"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msqrt>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msqrt>

   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134081462">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134081464">
     <para id="fs-id1165134081467"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135252123">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135252125">
     <para id="fs-id1165135252127"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>1</m:mn>
            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165135252184">
     <para id="fs-id1165135252186"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msqrt>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:msup>
            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:msup>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msqrt>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135525984">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135525986">
     <para id="fs-id1165135525988"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135526045">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135526047">
     <para id="fs-id1165135526049"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>1</m:mn>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165134081072">
     <para id="fs-id1165134081074"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msqrt>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:msup>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
         </m:msqrt>
        </m:mrow>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>

  </section>
  <section id="fs-id1165134081136">
   <title>Pengayaan</title>
   <para id="fs-id1165134081141">Untuk latihan berikut, evaluasi ekspresi tanpa menggunakan kalkulator. Berikan nilai eksak.</para>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134081145">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134081148">
     <para id="fs-id1165134081150"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>1</m:mn>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
          </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:msqrt>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
             </m:msqrt>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
          </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:msqrt>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
             </m:msqrt>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
          </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:msqrt>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
             </m:msqrt>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
          </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:msqrt>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
             </m:msqrt>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
          </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>1</m:mn>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
          </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mn>0</m:mn>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <para id="fs-id1165137666018">Untuk latihan berikut, carilah fungsi jika <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para><exercise id="fs-id1165137666021">
    <problem id="fs-id1165137666023">
     <para id="fs-id1165137666025"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1165137666039">
    <para id="fs-id1165137666041"> <m:math><m:mfrac><m:msqrt><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msqrt><m:mfenced open="|" close="|"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfenced></m:mfrac></m:math>
    </para>
   </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165137666083">
    <problem id="fs-id1165137666085">
     <para id="fs-id1165137666087"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165137666102">
    <problem id="fs-id1165137666104">
     <para id="fs-id1165137666106"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1165135532667">
    <para id="fs-id1165135532669"> <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
      </m:mfrac>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para>
   </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135532704">
    <problem id="fs-id1165135532706">
     <para id="fs-id1165135532708"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
         <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135532772">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134199337">
     <para id="fs-id1165134199339"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:mfrac>
    </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1165134199402">
     <para id="fs-id1165134199404"> <m:math>
      <m:mi>t</m:mi>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>

  </section>
  <section id="fs-id1165134199416">
   <title>Grafis</title>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134199421">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134199423">
     <para id="fs-id1165134199425">Gambarkan grafik <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> dan sebutkan domain dan range fungsinya.</para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165135306860"><problem id="fs-id1165135306863">
     <para id="fs-id1165135306865">Gambarkan grafik <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>arccos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> dan sebutkan domain dan range fungsinya.</para></problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1165135306888">
    <media id="fs-id1165135306896" alt="Grafik fungsi arkus kosinus x pada interval -1 hingga 1. Range fungsi adalah 0 hingga pi.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_204.jpg" />
    </media>
    <para id="fs-id1165135306909">domain <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> range <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
       <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para>
   </solution>
   </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165134311982">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134311985">
     <para id="fs-id1165134311987">Gambarkan satu siklus <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> dan sebutkan domain dan range fungsinya.</para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134312025">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134312027">
     <para id="fs-id1165134312029">Untuk nilai <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> berapakah <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> Gunakan kalkulator grafik untuk memperkirakan jawabannya.</para></problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1165134312084">
    <para id="fs-id1165134167454"> kira-kira <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.00</m:mn></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para>
   </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1165134167476">
    <problem id="fs-id1165134167478">
     <para id="fs-id1165134167480">Untuk nilai <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> berapakah <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> Gunakan kalkulator grafik untuk memperkirakan jawabannya.</para></problem>
   </exercise>

  </section>
  <section id="fs-id1165134167537">
   <title>Penerapan Dunia Nyata</title>


  <exercise id="fs-id1165134167542">
   <problem id="fs-id1165134167544">
    <para id="fs-id1165134167547">Misalkan sebuah tangga setinggi 13 kaki bersandar pada sebuah bangunan, mencapai bagian bawah jendela lantai dua yang berjarak 12 kaki di atas tanah. Berapa sudut dalam radian yang dibentuk tangga terhadap bangunan?</para></problem>

  <solution id="fs-id1165134167554">
   <para id="fs-id1165134167556">0.395 radian</para></solution>
  </exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165134167562">
   <problem id="fs-id1165134167564">
    <para id="fs-id1165134167566">Misalkan Anda berkendara sejauh 0.6 mil di jalan sehingga jarak vertikal berubah dari 0 menjadi 150 kaki. Berapakah sudut elevasi jalan tersebut?</para></problem>
  </exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135330848">
   <problem id="fs-id1165135330850">
    <para id="fs-id1165135330852">Sebuah segitiga sama kaki memiliki dua sisi yang kongruen dengan panjang 9 inci. Sisi sisanya memiliki panjang 8 inci. Temukan sudut yang dibuat oleh sisi 9 inci dengan sisi 8 inci. </para></problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165135330858">
   <para id="fs-id1165135330860">1.11 radian </para>
  </solution>
  </exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135330866">
   <problem id="fs-id1165135330868">
    <para id="fs-id1165135330870">Tanpa menggunakan kalkulator, perkirakan nilai <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>arctan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>,</m:mi><m:mn>000</m:mn></m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> Jelaskan mengapa jawaban Anda masuk akal.</para></problem>
  </exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135330906">
   <problem id="fs-id1165135330908">
    <para id="fs-id1165135330910">Rangka (struktur balok interior) untuk atap rumah dibuat dari dua segitiga siku-siku yang identik. Masing-masing memiliki alas 12 kaki dan tinggi 4 kaki. Temukan ukuran sudut lancip yang berdekatan dengan sisi 4 kaki.</para></problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165135330917">
   <para id="fs-id1165135330919">1.25 radian</para></solution>
  </exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135330924">
   <problem id="fs-id1165135330926">
    <para id="fs-id1165135330928">Garis <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       <m:mn>5</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math> melewati titik asal pada bidang <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>,<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>. Berapakah besar sudut yang dibentuk garis tersebut terhadap arah positif sumbu <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>?</para>
   </problem>
  </exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165134301396">
   <problem id="fs-id1165134301398">
    <para id="fs-id1165134301400">Garis <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow>
       <m:mn>7</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math> melewati titik asal pada bidang <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>,<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>. Berapakah besar sudut yang dibentuk garis tersebut terhadap arah negatif sumbu <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>?</para></problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165134301450">
   <para id="fs-id1165134301452">0.405 radian </para>
  </solution>
  </exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165134301458">
   <problem id="fs-id1165134301460">
    <para id="fs-id1165134301462">Berapa persentase kemiringan suatu jalan jika sudut elevasi jalan adalah 4 derajat? (Persentase kemiringan didefinisikan sebagai perubahan ketinggian jalan pada jarak horizontal 100 kaki. Misalnya kemiringan 5% berarti jalan meningkat 5 kaki untuk setiap jarak horizontal 100 kaki.)</para></problem>
  </exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165134301470">
   <problem id="fs-id1165134301472">
    <para id="fs-id1165134301474">Sebuah tangga setinggi 20 kaki disandarkan pada sisi sebuah bangunan sehingga kaki tangga berjarak 10 kaki dari dasar bangunan. Jika spesifikasi mengharuskan sudut elevasi tangga antara 35 dan 45 derajat, apakah penempatan tangga tersebut memenuhi spesifikasi keselamatan?</para></problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165134301481">
   <para id="fs-id1165134301483">Tidak. Sudut yang dibuat tangga terhadap horizontal adalah 60 derajat. </para>
  </solution>
  </exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165134301488">
   <problem id="fs-id1165134301491">
    <para id="fs-id1165134301493">Misalkan sebuah tangga setinggi 15 kaki bersandar pada sisi sebuah rumah sehingga sudut elevasi tangga tersebut adalah 42 derajat. Berapa jarak kaki tangga dari samping rumah?</para></problem>
  </exercise>
   </section>


</section>
<section id="fs-id1165135532546" class="review-exercises"><title>Latihan Tinjauan Bab</title><section id="eip-id1165135244084">
<title><link document="m49387">Grafik Fungsi Sinus dan Kosinus</link></title><para id="fs-id1165135532550">Untuk latihan berikut, gambarkan fungsi selama dua periode dan tentukan amplitudo atau faktor peregangan, periode, persamaan garis tengah, dan asimtotnya.</para>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135532555"><problem id="fs-id1165135532557">
<para id="fs-id1165135532559"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165135532597">
  <para id="fs-id1165135532619">amplitudo: 3; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> garis tengah: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> tidak ada asimtot<newline /></para><media id="fs-id1165135532605" alt="Grafik dua periode suatu fungsi dengan fungsi induk kosinus. Grafik mempunyai range [0,6] dan digambar dari -2pi hingga 2pi. Maksimumnya berada pada -pi dan pi." display="block">
    <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_206.jpg" />
   </media>


</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165135532662">
<problem id="fs-id1165135613494">
<para id="fs-id1165135613497"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135613536"><problem id="fs-id1165135613538">
<para id="fs-id1165135613540"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>6</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165135613593">

  <para id="fs-id1165135662443">amplitudo: 3; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> garis tengah: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> tidak ada asimtot<newline /></para><media id="fs-id1165135613601" alt="Grafik empat periode suatu fungsi dengan fungsi induk kosinus. Digambarkan dari -4pi hingga 4pi. Rentangnya adalah [-3,3]." display="block">
    <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_208.jpg" />
   </media>


</solution></exercise><exercise id="eip-id1165137897822">
<problem id="eip-id1165137897824">
  <para id="fs-id1165135662485"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>3</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>

  <exercise id="fs-id1165135662544"><problem id="fs-id1165135662546">
<para id="fs-id1165135662548"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165135640504">

<para id="fs-id1165135640526">amplitudo: 3; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> garis tengah: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> tidak ada asimtot<newline /></para>
   <media id="fs-id1165135640512" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi sinusoidal. Rentangnya adalah [-7,-1]. Maksimum pada -5pi/4 dan 3pi/4." display="block">
    <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_210.jpg" />
   </media>


</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165135640572">
<problem id="fs-id1165135640574">
<para id="fs-id1165135640576"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135547071"><problem id="fs-id1165135547073">
<para id="fs-id1165135547076"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>6</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165135328757">
  <para id="fs-id1165135328778">amplitudo: 6; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> garis tengah: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> tidak ada asimtot<newline /></para>
   <media id="fs-id1165135328765" alt="Grafik sinusoidal selama dua periode. Rentangnya [-7,5], amplitudo 6, dan periode 2pi/3." display="block">
    <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_212.jpg" />
   </media>


</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165135328835">
<problem id="fs-id1165135328837">
<para id="fs-id1165135328839"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>100</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>50</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
</section><section id="eip-id1165133021952"><title><link document="m49389">Grafik Fungsi Trigonometri Lainnya</link></title><para id="eip-id1165133021958">Untuk latihan berikut, gambarkan fungsi selama dua periode dan tentukan amplitudo atau faktor peregangan, periode,
persamaan garis tengah, dan asimtotnya.</para>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135203281"><problem id="fs-id1165135203283">
<para id="fs-id1165135203285"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165135203318"><para id="fs-id1165135203319">faktor peregangan: tidak ada; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> garis tengah: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow>
</m:math> adalah bilangan bulat<newline />
</para><media id="fs-id1165135203327" alt="Grafik fungsi tangen selama dua periode. Digambarkan dari -pi ke pi, dengan asimtot di -pi/2 dan pi/2." display="block">
    <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_214.jpg" />
   </media>


</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165135307791">
<problem id="fs-id1165135307793">
<para id="fs-id1165135307795"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>6</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135307848"><problem id="fs-id1165135307850">
<para id="fs-id1165135307852"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165135182781">

<para id="fs-id1165135182803">faktor peregangan: 3; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> garis tengah: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>8</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow>
</m:math> adalah bilangan bulat<newline />
 </para><media id="fs-id1165135182790" alt="Grafik fungsi tangen selama dua periode. Asimtot di -pi/8 dan pi/8. Periode pi/4. Garis tengah di y=-2." display="block">
    <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_216.jpg" />
   </media>

</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165135182894">
<problem id="fs-id1165135182896">
<para id="fs-id1165135182898"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.2</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>0.1</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>0.3</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>

  <para id="fs-id1165134248848">Untuk latihan berikut, buatlah grafik dua periode penuh. Tentukan periode, pergeseran fase, amplitudo, dan asimtotnya.</para>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165134248852"><problem id="fs-id1165134248854">
<para id="fs-id1165134248857"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165134248895">
  <para id="fs-id1165134248917">amplitudo: tidak ada; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:math> tidak ada pergeseran fase; asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow>
</m:math> adalah bilangan bulat ganjil<newline />
</para><media id="fs-id1165134248903" alt="Grafik dua periode dari fungsi sekan. Periode 2 pi, digambarkan dari -2pi hingga 2pi. Asimtot pada -3pi/2, -pi/2, pi/2, dan 3pi/2." display="block">
    <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_218.jpg" />
   </media>


</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165133362168">
<problem id="fs-id1165133362170">
<para id="fs-id1165133362172"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165133362204"><problem id="fs-id1165133362206">
<para id="fs-id1165133362208"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165133362252">

<para id="fs-id1165134310608">amplitudo: tidak ada; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>5</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> tidak ada pergeseran fase; asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>5</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow>
</m:math> adalah bilangan bulat<newline />
 </para><media id="fs-id1165133362259" alt="Grafik fungsi kosekan selama dua setengah periode. Digambarkan dari -pi ke pi, periode 2pi/5." display="block">
    <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_220.jpg" />
   </media>


</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165134310675">
<problem id="fs-id1165134310678">
<para id="fs-id1165134310680"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>1</m:mn>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135360172"><problem id="fs-id1165135360174">
<para id="fs-id1165135360176"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>1</m:mn>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165135360235">
<para id="fs-id1165135360256">amplitudo: tidak ada; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> tidak ada pergeseran fase; asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow>
</m:math> adalah bilangan bulat<newline /></para><media id="fs-id1165135360243" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi kosekan. Digambarkan dari -4pi hingga 4pi. Asimtot pada kelipatan 2pi. Periode 4pi." display="block">
    <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_222.jpg" />
   </media>

</solution></exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165135360302">
<problem id="fs-id1165135360304">
<para id="fs-id1165134339923"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>

  <para id="fs-id1165134339972">Untuk latihan berikut, gunakan skenario ini: Populasi suatu kota meningkat dan menurun dalam interval 20 tahun. Populasinya dapat dimodelkan dengan fungsi berikut: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>,</m:mi><m:mn>000</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>,</m:mi><m:mn>000</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>0.628</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>),</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan domain berupa banyaknya tahun sejak 1980 dan range berupa populasi kota.</para><exercise id="fs-id1165134340025">
<problem id="fs-id1165134340027">
<para id="fs-id1165134340030">Berapa populasi terbesar dan terkecil yang mungkin dimiliki kota ini?</para>
</problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165134340034">
<para id="fs-id1165134340036"> terbesar: 20,000; terkecil: 4,000</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165134340041">
<problem id="fs-id1165134340043">
<para id="fs-id1165134340046">Gambarkan fungsi pada domain <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>40</m:mn>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>.</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165137893233">
<problem id="fs-id1165137893235">
<para id="fs-id1165137893238">Berapa amplitudo, periode, dan pergeseran fase untuk fungsi tersebut?</para>
</problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165137893242">
<para id="fs-id1165137893244"> amplitudo: 8,000; periode: 10; pergeseran fase: 0 </para>
</solution>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165137893249">
<problem id="fs-id1165137893251">
<para id="fs-id1165137893254">Dalam domain ini, kapan populasi mencapai 18,000? 13,000?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165137893259">
<problem id="fs-id1165137893261">
<para id="fs-id1165137893263">Berapa perkiraan jumlah penduduk pada tahun 2007? 2010?</para>
</problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165137893267">
<para id="fs-id1165137893270"> Pada 2007, populasi yang diprediksi adalah 4,413. Pada 2010, populasinya menjadi 11,924. </para>
</solution>
</exercise>

  <para id="fs-id1165137893275">Untuk latihan berikut, misalkan sebuah beban diikat pada pegas dan bergerak naik turun secara simetris.</para>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165137893279" class="material-set-2">
<problem id="fs-id1165137893281">
<para id="fs-id1165137893283">Misalkan grafik fungsi perpindahan ditunjukkan pada <link target-id="Figure_06_03_225" />, dengan sumbu <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> menyatakan waktu dalam detik dan sumbu <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> menyatakan perpindahan dalam inci. Berikan persamaan yang memodelkan perpindahan vertikal beban pada pegas.</para>

  <figure id="Figure_06_03_225" class="small">
   <media id="fs-id1165137893308" alt="Grafik fungsi kosinus selama satu periode. Grafik digambar pada domain [0,10]. Range-nya adalah [-5,5].">
    <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_225.jpg" />
   </media>
  </figure>
</problem>
</exercise>

  <exercise id="fs-id1165137893324" class="material-set-2">
<problem id="fs-id1165137893326">
<para id="fs-id1165137893328">Pada waktu = 0, berapakah perpindahan beban tersebut?</para>
</problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165137893332">
<para id="fs-id1165137893335"> 5 inci.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165137893340" class="material-set-2">
<problem id="fs-id1165137893342"><para id="fs-id1165134189071">Pada waktu berapa perpindahan dari titik setimbang sama dengan nol?</para></problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165137893346" class="material-set-2">
<problem id="fs-id1165137893348">
<para id="fs-id1165137893351">Berapa waktu yang diperlukan agar beban kembali ke ketinggian awal 5 inci? Dengan kata lain, berapa periode fungsi perpindahannya?</para></problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165134086186">
<para id="fs-id1165134086188"> 10 detik</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
  </section><section id="eip-id1165132040469"><title><link document="m49390">Fungsi Trigonometri Invers</link></title><para id="fs-id1165134086194">Untuk latihan berikut, carilah nilai eksaknya tanpa bantuan kalkulator.</para>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165134086197">
<problem id="fs-id1165134086199">
<para id="fs-id1165134086201"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165134086240">
<problem id="fs-id1165134086243">
<para id="fs-id1165134086245"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msqrt>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165134086300">
<para id="fs-id1165134086302"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165134086323">
<problem id="fs-id1165134430315">
<para id="fs-id1165134430317"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
<m:mn>−1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
<m:mn>−1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165134430362">
<problem id="fs-id1165134430364">
<para id="fs-id1165134430366"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>1</m:mn>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msqrt>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165134430420">
<para id="fs-id1165134430422"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165134430443">
<problem id="fs-id1165134430445">
<para id="fs-id1165134430447"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135328650">
<problem id="fs-id1165135328652">
<para id="fs-id1165135328654"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>6</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165135328715">
<para id="fs-id1165135328717"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135328738">
<problem id="fs-id1165135328740">
<para id="fs-id1165135328742"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135388750">
<problem id="fs-id1165135388752">
<para id="fs-id1165135388754"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sec</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       <m:mn>5</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165135388815">
<para id="fs-id1165135388817">Tidak ada solusi</para></solution>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135388823">
<problem id="fs-id1165135388825">
<para id="fs-id1165135388827"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       <m:mn>5</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165134181826">
<problem id="fs-id1165134181828">
<para id="fs-id1165134181830"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>5</m:mn>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>13</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165134181894">
<para id="fs-id1165134181896"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>12</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>5</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>

  <exercise id="fs-id1165135333353">
<problem id="fs-id1165135333355">
<para id="fs-id1165135333357"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165135333426"><problem id="fs-id1165135333429">
<para id="fs-id1165135333431">Gambarkan grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> pada interval <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan jelaskan pengamatan apa pun.</para></problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165135388603">

  <para id="fs-id1165135388625">Grafiknya tidak simetris terhadap garis <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Grafik-grafik tersebut simetris terhadap sumbu <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>.<newline /></para><media id="fs-id1165135388611" alt="Grafik kosinus x dan sekan x. Kosinus x mencapai maksimum ketika sekan mencapai minimum, dan sebaliknya. Asimtot berada pada x=-3pi/2, -pi/2, pi/2, dan 3pi/2.">
    <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_226.jpg" />
   </media>

</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165135388663">
<problem id="fs-id1165135388665">
<para id="fs-id1165135388667">Gambarkan grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan jelaskan pengamatan apa pun.</para></problem>
</exercise>
  <exercise id="fs-id1165132005118"><problem id="fs-id1165132005121">
<para id="fs-id1165132005123">Gambarkan fungsi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi>
     <m:mn>3</m:mn>
    </m:msup>

   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>!</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi>
     <m:mn>5</m:mn>
    </m:msup>

   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>!</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi>
     <m:mn>7</m:mn>
    </m:msup>

   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>!</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> pada interval <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan bandingkan grafiknya dengan grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> pada interval yang sama. Jelaskan pengamatan apa pun.</para></problem>
  <solution id="fs-id1165135354967">
<para id="fs-id1165135354987">Grafiknya tampak identik.<newline /></para><media id="fs-id1165135354974" alt="Dua grafik dari dua fungsi identik pada interval [-1 hingga 1]. Kedua grafik tampak sinusoidal.">
    <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_228.jpg" />
   </media>


</solution>
</exercise></section></section>

<section id="fs-id1165135354994" class="practice-test">
<title>Tes Latihan Bab</title><para id="fs-id1165135354998">Untuk latihan berikut, buat sketsa grafik setiap fungsi untuk dua periode penuh. Tentukan amplitudo, periode, dan persamaan garis tengahnya.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135355003"><problem id="fs-id1165135355005">
<para id="fs-id1165135355007"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165134068899">
<para id="fs-id1165134068921">amplitudo: 0.5; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> garis tengah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <newline />
</para><media id="fs-id1165134068907" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi sinusoidal, digambar dari -2pi hingga 2pi. Range-nya adalah [-0.5,0.5]. Titik potong sumbu x berada pada kelipatan pi.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_229.jpg" />
</media>


</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165134068962">
<problem id="fs-id1165134068965">
<para id="fs-id1165134068967"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165134068999"><problem id="fs-id1165134069001">
<para id="fs-id1165134069003"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165134069034">

<para id="fs-id1165135320471">amplitudo: 5; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> garis tengah: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <newline />
</para><media id="fs-id1165134069042" alt="Dua periode fungsi sinus, digambarkan dalam grafik -2pi hingga 2pi. Kisarannya [-5,5], amplitudo 5, periode 2pi.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_231.jpg" />
</media>

</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165135320510">
<problem id="fs-id1165135320513">
<para id="fs-id1165135320515"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135320557"><problem id="fs-id1165135320560">
<para id="fs-id1165135320562"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>3</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165134254285">
<para id="fs-id1165134254307">amplitudo: 1; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> garis tengah: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <newline />
</para><media id="fs-id1165134254293" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi kosinus pada interval -7pi/3 hingga 5pi/3. Range-nya [0,2], periodenya 2pi, dan amplitudonya 1.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_233.jpg" />
</media>

</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165134254346">
<problem id="fs-id1165134254348">
<para id="fs-id1165134254350"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>6</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165134254421"><problem id="fs-id1165134254423">
<para id="fs-id1165134254425"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>1</m:mn>
     <m:mn>3</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>6</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165134116831">
<para id="fs-id1165134116851">amplitudo: 3; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> garis tengah: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <newline />
</para><media id="fs-id1165134116837" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi kosinus pada interval -7pi/2 hingga 17pi/2. Range-nya [-3,3], periodenya 6pi, dan amplitudonya 3.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_235.jpg" />
</media>

</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165134116890">
<problem id="fs-id1165134116892">
<para id="fs-id1165134116895"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165134567848"><problem id="fs-id1165134567850">
<para id="fs-id1165134567853"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>6</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165134567917">
<para id="fs-id1165134567936">amplitudo: tidak ada; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> garis tengah: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow>
</m:math> adalah bilangan bulat<newline />
</para><media id="fs-id1165134567923" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi tangen pada interval -5pi/6 hingga 7pi/6. Periodenya pi dan garis tengahnya y=0.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_237.jpg" />
</media>


</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165134567974">
<problem id="fs-id1165134567976">
<para id="fs-id1165134567978"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135367632"><problem id="fs-id1165135367635">
<para id="fs-id1165135367637"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135367680">

<para id="fs-id1165135367702">amplitudo: tidak ada; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> garis tengah: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>  asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:math>  dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow>
</m:math> adalah bilangan bulat<newline />
</para><media id="fs-id1165135367689" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi kosekan pada interval -2pi/3 hingga 2pi/3. Asimtot vertikal berada pada kelipatan pi/3. Periodenya 2pi/3.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_239.jpg" />
</media>


</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165135367752">
<problem id="fs-id1165135367755">
<para id="fs-id1165135367757"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135618274"><problem id="fs-id1165135618276">
<para id="fs-id1165135618278"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135618335">
<para id="fs-id1165135618356">amplitudo: tidak ada; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> garis tengah: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <newline />
</para><media id="fs-id1165135618343" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi kosekan, digambarkan dari -9pi/4 hingga 7pi/4. Periodenya 2pi, garis tengah di y=-3.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_241.jpg" />
</media>


</solution>
</exercise><para id="fs-id1165134174312">Untuk latihan berikut, tentukan amplitudo, periode, dan garis tengah grafik, lalu cari rumus fungsinya.</para>

<exercise id="fs-id1165134174317" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1165134174319">
<para id="fs-id1165134174341">Berikan dalam bentuk fungsi sinus.<newline /></para><media id="fs-id1165134174327" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi sinus, digambarkan dari -2 hingga 2. Rentangnya adalah [-6,-2], periodenya 2, dan amplitudonya 2.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_242.jpg" />
</media>


</problem>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165134174346" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1165134174348">
<para id="fs-id1165134174370">Berikan dalam bentuk fungsi sinus.<newline /></para><media id="fs-id1165134174356" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi sinus, digambarkan dalam grafik -2 hingga 2. Rentangnya adalah [-2,2], periodenya 2, dan amplitudonya 2.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_243.jpg" />
</media>


</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165134174374">
<para id="fs-id1165134174376">amplitudo: 2; periode: 2; garis tengah: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165134174454"><problem id="fs-id1165134174456">
<para id="fs-id1165135600271">Berikan dalam bentuk fungsi tangen.<newline /></para><media id="fs-id1165135600258" alt="Grafik dua periode tangen, digambarkan dalam grafik -3pi/4 hingga 5pi/4. Asimtot vertikal pada x=-pi/4, 3pi/4. Periode adalah pi.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_244.jpg" />
</media>


</problem>
</exercise><para id="fs-id1165135600276">Untuk latihan berikut, carilah amplitudo, periode, pergeseran fase, dan garis tengah.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135600280" class="material-set-2">
<problem id="fs-id1165135600282">
<para id="fs-id1165135600284"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>6</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135600332">
<para id="fs-id1165135600334">amplitudo: 1; periode: 12; pergeseran fase: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>−6</m:mn><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> garis tengah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−3</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135600376" class="material-set-2">
<problem id="fs-id1165135600378">
<para id="fs-id1165135600380"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>6</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165134195338" class="material-set-2">
<problem id="fs-id1165134195340">
<para id="fs-id1165134195342">Suhu luar sepanjang hari dapat dimodelkan sebagai fungsi sinusoidal. Misalkan suhu pada tengah malam adalah 68°F, sedangkan suhu tertinggi dan terendah pada hari itu masing-masing adalah 80°F dan 56°F. Dengan menganggap <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>t</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> menyatakan jumlah jam sejak tengah malam, tentukan fungsi suhu <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> sebagai fungsi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165134195393">
<para id="fs-id1165134195395"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>t</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>68</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>12</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165134195459" class="material-set-2">
<problem id="fs-id1165134195461">
<para id="fs-id1165134195463">Air dipompa ke dalam bak penyimpanan dan keluar dengan laju periodik. Kedalaman air mencapai nilai terendah 3 kaki pada pukul 2:00 dini hari dan nilai tertinggi 71 kaki setiap 5 jam. Tuliskan fungsi kosinus yang memodelkan kedalaman air sebagai fungsi waktu, lalu gambarkan fungsi itu untuk satu periode.</para></problem>
</exercise>

<para id="fs-id1165134188865">Untuk latihan berikut, tentukan periode dan pergeseran horizontal setiap fungsi.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1165134188868" class="material-set-2">
<problem id="fs-id1165134188870">
<para id="fs-id1165134188872"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>42</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165134188920">
<para id="fs-id1165134188922">periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> pergeseran horizontal: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>−7</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165134188965" class="material-set-2">
<problem id="fs-id1165134188967">
<para id="fs-id1165134188969"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>3</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>3</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165134418812" class="material-set-2">
<problem id="fs-id1165134418814">
<para id="fs-id1165134418816">Tuliskan persamaan grafik di <link target-id="Figure_06_03_246" /> dalam bentuk fungsi sekan serta berikan periode dan pergeseran fasenya.</para>
<figure id="Figure_06_03_246" class="small">
<media id="fs-id1165134418830" alt="Grafik 2 periode fungsi sekan, digambarkan pada -2 hingga 2. Periodenya adalah 2 dan tidak ada pergeseran fase.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_246.jpg" />
</media>
</figure>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165134418845">
<para id="fs-id1165134418847"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> periode: 2; pergeseran fase: 0</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165134418895" class="material-set-2">
<problem id="fs-id1165134418897">
<para id="fs-id1165134418899">Jika <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> tentukan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165134418956">
<problem id="fs-id1165134418958">
<para id="fs-id1165134418960">Jika <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> tentukan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165134129832">
<para id="fs-id1165134129834"> <m:math>
 <m:mn>4</m:mn>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>

<para id="fs-id1165134129845">Untuk latihan berikut, buat grafik fungsi pada jendela yang ditentukan dan jawab pertanyaannya.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1165134129849">
<problem id="fs-id1165134129851">
<para id="fs-id1165134129853">Gambarkan grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> pada jendela tampilan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Perkirakan periode grafik.</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165134368026"><problem id="fs-id1165134368028">
<para id="fs-id1165134368031">Gambarkan grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.02</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>50</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> pada domain berikut di <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>:</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Misalkan fungsi ini memodelkan gelombang suara. Mengapa pandangan ini terlihat sangat berbeda?</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165134368153">

<para id="fs-id1165135436270">Pandangannya berbeda karena periode gelombangnya <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>25</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Pada domain yang lebih besar, akan ada lebih banyak siklus grafik. </para>
<media id="fs-id1165134368161" alt="Dua grafik fungsi sinusoidal yang berdampingan. Grafik pertama digambar dari 0 hingga 1, sedangkan grafik kedua digambar dari 0 hingga 3. Keduanya memuat banyak periode.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_248.jpg" />
</media>

</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165135436304">
<problem id="fs-id1165135436306">
<para id="fs-id1165135436308">Gambarkan grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac></m:mrow>
</m:math> pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn></m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
</m:math> dan jelaskan pengamatan apa pun.</para></problem>
</exercise>

<para id="fs-id1165135436313">Untuk latihan berikut, misalkan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
   <m:mn>5</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135436369">
<problem id="fs-id1165135436371">
<para id="fs-id1165135436374">Berapa nilai terbesar yang mungkin untuk <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>?</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135436402">
<para id="fs-id1165135436404"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
   <m:mn>5</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135436425">
<problem id="fs-id1165135436427">
<para id="fs-id1165135436429">Berapa nilai terkecil yang mungkin untuk <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>?</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165131863131">
<problem id="fs-id1165131863133">
<para id="fs-id1165131863135">Pada bagian mana fungsi meningkat dalam interval <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>?</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165131863169">
<para id="fs-id1165131863171">Pada interval perkiraan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1.6</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2.1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2.6</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3.1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3.7</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>4.2</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>4.7</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5.2</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5.6</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>6.28</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>

<para id="fs-id1165137701904">Untuk latihan berikut, cari dan buat grafik satu periode fungsi periodik dengan amplitudo, periode, dan pergeseran fase tertentu.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1165137701908">
<problem id="fs-id1165137701911">
<para id="fs-id1165137701913">Kurva sinus dengan amplitudo 3, periode <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan pergeseran fase <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>k</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165137701995"><problem id="fs-id1165137701997">
<para id="fs-id1165137702000">Kurva kosinus dengan amplitudo 2, periode <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan pergeseran fase <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>k</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135440259"><para id="fs-id1165135440260"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>

<media id="fs-id1165135440335" alt="Grafik satu periode fungsi kosinus, digambarkan pada -pi/4 hingga 0. Rentangnya adalah [1,5], periodenya adalah pi/6.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_251.jpg" />
</media>

</solution>
</exercise><para id="fs-id1165135440351">Untuk latihan berikut, buat grafik fungsinya. Jelaskan grafiknya dan, jika memungkinkan, setiap perilaku periodik, amplitudo, asimtot, atau titik yang tidak terdefinisi.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135440355">
<problem id="fs-id1165135440358">
<para id="fs-id1165135440360"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135196587"><problem id="fs-id1165135196588"><para id="fs-id1165135196589"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mi>e</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi></m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135196592">

<para id="fs-id1165135196613">Grafik ini periodik dengan periode <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
<media id="fs-id1165135196600" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi sinusoidal. Grafik tersebut memiliki periode 2pi.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_254.jpg" />
</media>

</solution>
</exercise><para id="fs-id1165135196635">Untuk latihan berikut, carilah nilai eksaknya.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135196638">
<problem id="fs-id1165135196640">
<para id="fs-id1165135196642"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msqrt>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135196698">
<problem id="fs-id1165135196700">
<para id="fs-id1165135196702"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msqrt>
     <m:mn>3</m:mn>
    </m:msqrt>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135196747">
<para id="fs-id1165135196749"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
 </para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135538805">
<problem id="fs-id1165135538808">
<para id="fs-id1165135538810"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msqrt>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135538867">
<problem id="fs-id1165135538869">
<para id="fs-id1165135538872"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135538923">
<para id="fs-id1165135538925"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135538945">
<problem id="fs-id1165135538947">
<para id="fs-id1165135538949"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135349316">
<problem id="fs-id1165135349318">
<para id="fs-id1165135349320"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135349381">
<para id="fs-id1165135349383"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msqrt>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>

   </m:mrow>
  </m:msqrt>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135349434">
<problem id="fs-id1165135349436">
<para id="fs-id1165135349438"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.4</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135317556">
<problem id="fs-id1165135317559">
<para id="fs-id1165135317561"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>

     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135317622">
<para id="fs-id1165135317624"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msqrt>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:msup>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:msqrt>

   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>

<para id="fs-id1165135317664">Untuk latihan berikut, misalkan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
Evaluasilah ekspresi berikut.
</para><exercise id="fs-id1165135317703"><problem id="fs-id1165135317705">
<para id="fs-id1165135317707"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1165135499591">
<problem id="fs-id1165135499593">
<para id="fs-id1165135499595"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135499610">
<para id="fs-id1165135499612"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135499640" class="material-set-2">
<problem id="fs-id1165135499642">
<para id="fs-id1165135499644">Diketahui <link target-id="Image_06_03_255" />, carilah besar sudut <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> hingga tiga angka desimal. Jawab dalam radian.</para><figure id="Image_06_03_255" class="small">
<media id="fs-id1165135499668" alt="Ilustrasi segitiga siku-siku dengan sudut theta. Di hadapan sudut theta terdapat sisi yang panjangnya 12; di dekat sudut theta terdapat sisi yang panjangnya 19.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_03_255.jpg" />
</media>
</figure>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id1165135499684">Untuk latihan berikut, tentukan apakah persamaan tersebut benar atau salah.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135499687">
<problem id="fs-id1165135499689">
<para id="fs-id1165135499691"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>arcsin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>6</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135499758">
<para id="fs-id1165135499760"> Salah</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135499765">
<problem id="fs-id1165135499767">
<para id="fs-id1165135499769"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>arccos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>6</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1165135407385">
<problem id="fs-id1165135407387">
<para id="fs-id1165135407389">Kemiringan suatu jalan adalah 7%. Artinya untuk setiap jarak horizontal 100 kaki di jalan, kenaikan vertikalnya adalah 7 kaki. Tentukan sudut jalan terhadap garis horizontal dalam radian. </para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165135407395">
<para id="fs-id1165135407397">sekitar 0.07 radian</para></solution>
</exercise>
</section>
</content>
<glossary>
<definition id="fs-id1165135407407">
<term>arkus kosinus</term>
<meaning id="fs-id1165135407412">nama lain dari kosinus invers; <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>arccos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id1165135407453">
<term>arkus sinus</term>
<meaning id="fs-id1165135407459">nama lain dari sinus invers; <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>arcsin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id1165135407500">
<term>arkus tangen</term>
<meaning id="fs-id1165135407505">nama lain untuk tangen invers; <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>arctan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id1165134357638">
<term>fungsi kosinus invers</term> <meaning id="fs-id1165134357643">fungsi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> yang merupakan invers fungsi kosinus, yaitu sudut yang kosinusnya sama dengan bilangan yang diberikan</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id1165134357681">
<term>fungsi sinus invers</term> <meaning id="fs-id1165134357687">fungsi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> yang merupakan invers fungsi sinus, yaitu sudut yang sinusnya sama dengan bilangan yang diberikan</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id1165134357726">
<term>fungsi tangen invers</term> <meaning id="fs-id1165134357732">fungsi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> yang merupakan invers fungsi tangen, yaitu sudut yang tangennya sama dengan bilangan yang diberikan</meaning>
</definition>
</glossary>
</document>